  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In this scene, Max agrees to help behind the restaurant bar and marvels at the computerized cash register. When Nastya comes in to order two espressos, she is surprised to see a cook posing as the new bartender. Listen to their playful exchange in Russian first, and then we will review it in English.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Так вот как выглядит эта система.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я думал, это просто касса.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Сделай два эспрессо, пожалуйста.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Что ты тут делаешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А я теперь новый бармен.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Да ладно тебе выдумывать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я тебя на кухне видела.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ты же повар.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "У меня очень много талантов.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А в душе я бармен.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Костя уже починил аппарат?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Конечно, всё прекрасно работает.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Тогда быстрее вари кофе.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Сию секунду. Всё будет готово.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's review this funny encounter behind the bar line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Так вот как выглядит эта система.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So this is what this system looks like.' Max inspects the computerized cash register at the bar.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я думал, это просто касса.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I thought it was just a cash register.' Admitting he expected something much simpler.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Сделай два эспрессо, пожалуйста.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Make two espressos, please.' Nastya arrives at the bar with a beverage order.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Что ты тут делаешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you doing here?' Surprised to find a kitchen helper standing behind the bar counter.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А я теперь новый бармен.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And I am now the new bartender.' Max confidently invents a new position for himself.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Да ладно тебе выдумывать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, stop making things up.' She is dismissing his boastful claim.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я тебя на кухне видела.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I saw you in the kitchen.' Pointing out that she already recognized him from earlier.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ты же повар.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are a cook after all.' Reminding him of his actual job title.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "У меня очень много талантов.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have very many talents.' Boasting about his versatility.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А в душе я бармен.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And at heart I am a bartender.' A poetic Russian idiom meaning deep down inside his soul.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Костя уже починил аппарат?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did Kostya already fix the machine?' Checking if the broken bar equipment is functioning.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Конечно, всё прекрасно работает.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course, everything works wonderfully.' Reassuring her that the order can be completed without delay.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Тогда быстрее вари кофе.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then make coffee faster.' Giving a direct order to hurry up with the drinks.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Сию секунду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right away.' An idiom literally meaning 'this very second'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Всё будет готово.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything will be ready.' Promising swift service. Alright, let's hear the whole conversation once again.",
      "gap": 0.9
